  "rationale": "program_safety assumes a well-formed class table, SequenceTyped from the empty environment to the chosen final environment, and an arbitrary extended Steps prefix from empty storage. It concludes not Stuck, finished-or-successor, a counted prefix, a continuation of length configuration.code.length, equality of prefix plus continuation with initial code length, and a finished final state realizing the same final environment. Thus every supplied execution prefix extends to exact-length completion, rather than merely exhibiting one terminating run from the initial state. given.typing.configurations defines counted transitions; progress, preservation, and statement typing introduce the remaining notions. No destruction or empty final environment is required.",
